      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CASSIO.\nYet, I beseech you,\nIf you think fit, or that it may be done,\nGive me advantage of some brief discourse\nWith Desdemona alone.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
